2026-07-27T09:38:17.4002858Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4003629Z i /tmp/RtmpvxpieM/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4003989Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4004416Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4005112Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4005688Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4006554Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4007853Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4251138Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4360808Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4794061Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:38:17.4943811Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
